:20抵達目前不用排隊！）\n-\n點餐是用點餐機，只能現金付款（但有提供刷載具的發票），老闆是日本人，整個就是非常道地日本感，店內空間蠻大的，用餐起來也還算舒適～\n-\n麵鹹度可以分日本鹹度跟台灣鹹度，據同行夥伴一訪的心得是日本鹹度有點過鹹，他這次點台灣鹹度覺得適中也比較好吃😋\n這次點了濃厚牡蠣雞白湯，另外加了牡蠣（因為點特製的話會多肉，但只有想多加牡蠣🦪）\n覺得整體味道很喜歡！濃郁但又吃得到個別的味道，不會都彼此混在在一起，是吃得懂的好吃拉麵！\n另一個點的是香辣魚介雞白湯，也是濃厚好吃，但香辣調味料真的蠻辣的，加下去又是另一種感覺💕\n牡蠣炊飯也好吃！飯的口感軟硬適中～覺得很不錯\n整體來說推推！！是路過會想走進來吃的拉麵店🍜",null,[0,32]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/15754959952096567650/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnR3UkUxSFpHRlBWMDVPVGtaV2RGSnVRbUZTUlhCM1VsWmtibHByUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15754959952096567650/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnR3UkUxSFpHRlBWMDVPVGtaV2RGSnVRbUZTUlhCM1VsWmtibHByUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/15754959952096567650/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnR3UkUxSFpHRlBWMDVPVGtaV2RGSnVRbUZTUlhCM1VsWmtibHByUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15754959952096567650/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnR3UkUxSFpHRlBWMDVPVGtaV2RGSnVRbUZTUlhCM1VsWmtibHByUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/15754959952096567650/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnR3UkUxSFpHRlBWMDVPVGtaV2RGSnVRbUZTUlhCM1VsWmtibHByUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15754959952096567650/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnR3UkUxSFpHRlBWMDVPVGtaV2RGSnVRbUZTUlhCM1VsWmtibHByUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,2729,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2twRE1HZGFPV05OTkZWdFJuQmFSRXB3UlZkblprRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x429f4cf327b52e44!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkpDMGdaOWNNNFVtRnBaREpwRVdnZkE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2twRE1HZGFPV05OTkZWdFJuQmFSRXB3UlZkblprRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2twRE1HZGFPV05OTkZWdFJuQmFSRXB3